A woman comes to the café.
She stands near the counter.
She wants a coffee.
I am learning to make coffee today.
This is my first coffee.
I go near the machine.
I place the cup under the machine.
Then I heat the milk.
But I do not know the right time.
The milk becomes too hot.
That coffee is completely ruined.
Seeing that, I become sad.
Sunita smiles gently.
She says, "Maya, do not worry."
She quickly cleans the counter.
Sunita immediately makes another coffee.
That coffee is perfect.
She gives the cup to the woman.
The woman smiles and says thank you.
I watch Sunita carefully.
